    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dembigii Reer Binu Israa'iil Iyo Baarrinnimadii Addoonka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Meeday warqaddii furniinka ee hooyadiin, oo aan ku eryay? Waase kuma kan ka mid ah kuwa daynka iga qaba oo aan idinka iibiyey? Bal eega, xumaatooyinkiina aawadood ayaa laydiin iibiyey, oo xadgudubyadiinna aawadood ayaa hooyadiin lagu furay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba markaan imid, muxuu ninna u jirin? Oo markaan dhawaaqayse maxaa la iigu jawaabi waayay? Miyaa innaba gacantaydu gaaban tahay si ayan wax u furan karin? Amase miyaanan lahayn xoog aan wax ku samatabbixiyo? Bal eega, canaantayda ayaan badda ku engejiyaa, oo webiyaashana cidlo baan ka dhigaa. Kalluunkoodu biyola'aan aawadeed buu la soo uraa, oo oon buu u dhintaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samooyinka madow baan huwiyaa, oo dhar joonyad ah ayaan go' uga dhigaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ah ayaa afka kuwa wax bartay i siiyey inaan ogaado si aan hadal ugu taageero kan daallan. Subax kastuu i toosiyaa, subax walbana dhegtayduu u toosiyaa inaan wax u maqlo sida kuwa wax bartay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ah ayaa dhegtayda furay, oo aniguna ma aan caasiyoobin, oo dibna ugama aan noqon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwii i karbaashay ayaan dhabarkaygii u duway, oo kuwii timaha iga rifayna dhabannadaydaan u duway. Wejigaygiina ceeb iyo candhuuf toona kama aan qarin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, waxaa i caawin doona Sayidka Rabbiga ah, oo sidaas daraaddeed ma aan sharaf jabin, oo sidaas daraaddeed ayaan wejigaygii uga dhigay sidii dhagaxmadow oo kale, oo waxaan ogahay inaanan ceeboobi doonin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka xaq iga dhiga wuu dhow yahay, bal yaa ila diriraya? Aannu isla wada istaagno. Waa kuma kan cadowgayga ahu? Ha ii soo dhowaado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eega, Sayidka Rabbiga ah ayaa i caawinaya, haddaba waa kuma kan i xukumi doonaa? Bal ogaada, iyagu dhammaantood sida dhar duugoobay bay u gaboobi doonaan, oo kulligood aboor baa cuni doona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal yaa idinka mid ah oo Rabbiga ka cabsada, oo codka addoonkiisa addeeca? Kan gudcurka ku dhex socda, oo aan iftiin lahaynu magaca Rabbiga ha aamino, oo Ilaahiisa ha isku halleeyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwiinna dabka shida, oo ololka isku hareereeya oo dhammow, iftiinka dabkiinna iyo ololka aad shidateen ku socda. Waxaas gacantaydaad ka heli doontaan, oo waxaad ku jiifsan doontaan tiiraanyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
